    given-names: John
    affiliation: "Blas / Tonada"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/johnway114/teanga-bench"
url: "https://research.blasapp.com"
abstract: >-
  Teanga Bench measures how well large language models perform the work of a
  language tutor across two suites: the Blas suite (Irish, Welsh, Scottish
  Gaelic, Manx, Breton, and Cornish) and the Tonada suite (English tutoring
  for Portuguese, Spanish, Vietnamese, and Japanese L1 learners).
